sequenceDiagram
    actor Researcher as Student Researcher
    participant Web as Lab Web App
    participant API as Scheduling API
    participant Policy as Policy Engine
    participant SSO as University SSO
    database DB as Reservation DB
    participant Gateway as Sensor Gateway
    participant Alert as Alert Service
    participant Ticket as Maintenance Service
    participant Notify as Notification Gateway

    Researcher->>Web: Select equipment and time slot
    Web->>API: Create reservation draft
    API->>SSO: Verify researcher group
    SSO-->>API: Group membership
    API->>Policy: Check quota, room level and conflicts
    alt Slot is allowed
        Policy-->>API: Accepted
        API->>DB: Save confirmed reservation
        API-->>Web: Reservation confirmation
        Web-->>Researcher: Show booking code
    else Slot violates policy
        Policy-->>API: Rejection reason
        API-->>Web: Policy explanation
        Web-->>Researcher: Show alternatives
    end
    loop During reserved session
        Gateway->>Alert: Publish temperature and humidity frame
        Alert->>DB: Read active reservation and asset owner
        alt Unsafe reading detected
            Alert->>Ticket: Open maintenance ticket
            Ticket->>Notify: Send technician alert
            Notify-->>Researcher: Send safety notice
        else Reading normal
            Alert-->>Gateway: Acknowledge frame
        end
    end
    Researcher->>Web: Finish session
    Web->>API: Release equipment
    API->>DB: Mark reservation completed
